{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_012g9EBs3oPJ8wn4Prj63VJY","type":"tool_result","content":"**`versions secret bulk`:** The section describes it as \"Create or update a secret variable for a Worker.\" Its `[FILE]` option is described as \"The file of key-value pairs to upload, as JSON in form {\"key\": value, ...} or .dev.vars file in the form KEY=VALUE.\" The docs don't mention deleting secrets in this section.\n\n**`versions secret delete`:** The section describes it as \"Delete a secret variable from a Worker.\" Its `[KEY]` option is described as \"The variable name to be accessible in the Worker.\"\n\nThe deletion note you may be thinking of appears under the top-level `secret bulk` command, not `versions secret bulk`: \"Deleting secrets by setting a key to `null` requires wrangler version 4.97.0 or later and JSON format.\" It adds: \"Deletion is not supported with `.env` files.\""}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"98ca052b-c609-4020-bf42-c03073586cbc","uuid":"eb4334bc-5a42-4f4e-8849-5efcb2c0f8e8","timestamp":"2026-10-08T12:18:49.372Z","tool_use_result":{"bytes":75803,"code":200,"codeText":"OK","result":"**`versions secret bulk`:** The section describes it as \"Create or update a secret variable for a Worker.\" Its `[FILE]` option is described as \"The file of key-value pairs to upload, as JSON in form {\"key\": value, ...} or .dev.vars file in the form KEY=VALUE.\" The docs don't mention deleting secrets in this section.\n\n**`versions secret delete`:** The section describes it as \"Delete a secret variable from a Worker.\" Its `[KEY]` option is described as \"The variable name to be accessible in the Worker.\"\n\nThe deletion note you may be thinking of appears under the top-level `secret bulk` command, not `versions secret bulk`: \"Deleting secrets by setting a key to `null` requires wrangler version 4.97.0 or later and JSON format.\" It adds: \"Deletion is not supported with `.env` files.\"","durationMs":4974,"url":"https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers/wrangler/commands/workers/"},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_012g9EBs3oPJ8wn4Prj63VJY","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
